        "@value": "TICKET LINK IN THE DESCRIPTION BELOW&#010;Join us for a celebration of Heiltsuk stewardship, community resilience, and surf as we share an updated version of the film, Groundswell, and the stories behind the defeat of Enbridge’s Northern Gateway pipeline. "
